# KiCad Project Context

- Treat the root `AGENTS.md` as the canonical repository instructions.
- Start navigation from `README.md` and `workflows/agent-context-map.md`.
- Discover reusable workflows from `.agents/skills/**/SKILL.md`. Cursor can
  invoke these project skills from the `/` menu; do not copy them into rules.
- Files under `.codex/agents/` configure Codex only. They are not Cursor rules
  or Cursor subagent definitions.
- Keep deterministic commands in the parent agent. Delegate only bounded
  research, validation, architecture, or review work.
